er open and honest approach to love constantly throws the awkward protagonist off guard. But if it\u2019ll make him smile\u2014even just a little\u2014she\u2019ll give it her all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally obsessed with the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her favorite thing in the world? The food he cooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchphrase: \u201cUguu~ Mr. Caretaker, feed me, please!\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Game Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Spine Live2D-style sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4~6 hour short romance visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful CG illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An uninvited fox spirit girl suddenly appears, determined to absorb the purest life essence\u2014by having a romance that's both sultry and thrilling! And so begins a heart-pounding, sweat-inducing cohabitation life! This is a short romance visual novel guaranteed to make you smile!",
